function treeOrderingDropKind(source,destination,data=orderingData()){if(!source||!destination)return "";const sourceRoot=rootOrderKey(source,data),destinationRoot=rootOrderKey(destination,data);if(sourceRoot&&destinationRoot&&sourceRoot!==destinationRoot)return "root";const parents=data.category_parents||{};if(source.kind==="category"&&destination.kind==="category"&&source.category!==destination.category&&(parents[source.category]||"")===(parents[destination.category]||""))return "category";if(source.kind==="site-category"&&destination.kind==="site-category"&&source.category!==destination.category)return "site-category";if(source.kind==="target"&&destination.kind==="target"&&source.target_key!==destination.target_key&&targetSiblingItems(source.target_key).some(item=>item.payload?.target_key===destination.target_key))return "target";return ""}
